Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.22,0:23:57.02,OP JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5\1c&HC4E33B&}I cannot believe it!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.02,0:23:59.22,OP JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5\1c&HC4E33B&}The world I used to know is gone
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.42,0:24:04.42,OP JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5}I just woke up one day and everything changed
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.02,0:24:09.42,OP JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5}Zetsubou risou
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.22,0:24:14.22,OP JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5}Yudanerare majiwaru sekai
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.62,0:24:16.22,OP JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5}Are you excited?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.22,0:24:21.22,OP JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5}Netsu obiru toiki jouki suru hoho
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.22,0:24:25.82,OP JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5}Shisen no saki de kimi ga warau
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.12,0:24:29.82,OP JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5\1c&HC4E33B&}Namida ukabetemo sakendemo
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.82,0:24:32.12,OP JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5\1c&HC4E33B&}Tomaranai shoudou
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.02,0:24:39.42,OP JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5}Nigirishimeta yakusoku hanasanaide kimi wo kanjiru kara
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.92,0:24:45.22,OP JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5}Tsuranuite miseru yo kakujitsu na toko made
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.22,0:24:50.32,OP JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5\1c&HC4E33B&}Daremo shiranai michi no ryouiki nara oshihiraite
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.32,0:24:56.02,OP JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5\1c&H1181F1&}Omoidasu yo tsuyoku mabushii hitomi wo
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.02,0:25:01.72,OP JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5}Daremo yaranai nara jibun de yaru shika nai
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.72,0:25:05.42,OP JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5}Just gotta do it
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.22,0:23:57.02,OP BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5\1c&HC4E33B&}Eu não posso acreditar nisso!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.02,0:23:59.22,OP BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5\1c&HC4E33B&}O mundo que eu conhecia já não existe mais.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.42,0:24:04.42,OP BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5}Um dia acordei e tudo mudou.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.02,0:24:09.42,OP BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5}Desespero, ideais...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.22,0:24:14.22,OP BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5}e um mundo entrelaçado que foi confiado a mim.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.62,0:24:16.22,OP BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5}Você está animado?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.22,0:24:21.22,OP BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5}Sua respiração está quente, suas bochechas estão coradas.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.22,0:24:25.82,OP BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5}Vejo você rindo em meus olhos.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.12,0:24:29.82,OP BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5\1c&HC4E33B&}Não importa quantas lágrimas eu chore, quantos gritos eu grite,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.82,0:24:32.12,OP BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5\1c&HC4E33B&}não consigo parar este impulso.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.02,0:24:39.42,OP BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5}A promessa a que me agarro, não vou desistir, porque o sinto.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.92,0:24:45.22,OP BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5}Vou certificar até que você esteja seguro.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.22,0:24:50.32,OP BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5\1c&HC4E33B&}Se é um território desconhecido, eu o abrirei.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.32,0:24:56.02,OP BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5\1c&H1181F1&}Eu me lembrarei desses olhos fortes e deslumbrantes.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.02,0:25:01.72,OP BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5}Se ninguém o faz, eu mesmo tenho que fazê-lo.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.72,0:25:05.42,OP BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5}Só tem que ser feito.
